WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.255
Wukong stood before Guanyin.

2
00:00:06.256 --> 00:00:11.318
He was telling the bodhisattva everything that had happened at the monastery.

3
00:00:11.319 --> 00:00:16.817
"Then a bear spirit called the Black Wind King stole the robe," the monkey went on.

4
00:00:16.818 --> 00:00:20.133
"I demanded he give it back.

5
00:00:20.134 --> 00:00:25.626
We fought—until the bear spirit said it was lunchtime and hid in his cave.

6
00:00:25.627 --> 00:00:29.830
I kicked the door and yelled insults at him for more than an hour.

7
00:00:29.831 --> 00:00:33.364
[g@But he wouldn't come out.

8
00:00:33.365 --> 00:00:36.613
You must help me."@g]

9
00:00:36.614 --> 00:00:44.046
Guanyin sighed. "The Tang Monk should not have shown that robe to the priest," she said.

10
00:00:44.047 --> 00:00:47.281
"The robe is a Buddhist treasure.

11
00:00:47.282 --> 00:00:51.560
When other people see it, they will want it.

12
00:00:51.561 --> 00:00:57.385
And as that head priest tried to do, they might harm the Tang Monk."

13
00:00:57.386 --> 00:00:59.875
"I agree," said Wukong.

14
00:00:59.876 --> 00:01:05.747
"I've told the Tang Monk many times not to do dumb things. But still he—"

15
00:01:05.748 --> 00:01:12.322
"And you should have put out that fire," Guanyin said, interrupting Wukong.

16
00:01:12.323 --> 00:01:15.620
"What you did was terrible!"

17
00:01:15.621 --> 00:01:18.573
Wukong looked at the ground.

18
00:01:18.574 --> 00:01:20.837
[g@He kicked a pebble.

19
00:01:20.838 --> 00:01:23.897
"I know," he mumbled.@g]

20
00:01:23.898 --> 00:01:30.099
"I'll help you get back the robe," said Guanyin. "Let's go."

21
00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:34.739
Wukong and Guanyin soared over the ocean.

22
00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:38.499
Soon they landed on the mountain.

23
00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:43.290
"Where is the Black Wind King's cave?" asked Guanyin.

24
00:01:43.291 --> 00:01:45.588
[g@"It's close," said Wukong.

25
00:01:45.589 --> 00:01:47.535
"We should sneak up to it."@g]

26
00:01:47.536 --> 00:01:50.208
They heard footsteps coming closer.

27
00:01:50.209 --> 00:01:55.221
Wukong and Guanyin hid as a Daoist priest walked along the path.

28
00:01:55.222 --> 00:01:57.526
[g@The priest was holding a tray.

29
00:01:57.527 --> 00:02:00.980
A bright purple pill sat on the tray.@g]

30
00:02:00.981 --> 00:02:04.215
[g@The priest was talking to himself.

31
00:02:04.216 --> 00:02:07.112
"This is an exciting day," he said.@g]

32
00:02:07.113 --> 00:02:10.960
"The Black Wind King has a new robe that is a Buddhist treasure.

33
00:02:10.961 --> 00:02:13.643
And I hope he likes the pill I made for him.

34
00:02:13.644 --> 00:02:19.497
It will make him live forever."

35
00:02:19.498 --> 00:02:27.237
Wukong stared at the priest, using his magic sight.

36
00:02:27.238 --> 00:02:30.310
"That's not a priest!" Wukong realized.

37
00:02:30.311 --> 00:02:33.862
[g@"It's a wolf spirit dressed as a priest."

38
00:02:33.863 --> 00:02:36.492
The monkey's eyes lit up.@g]

39
00:02:36.493 --> 00:02:40.459
"I have an idea, Bodhisattva!"

40
00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:46.693
A little while later, the priest stood before the Black Wind King's cave door.

41
00:02:46.694 --> 00:02:50.238
He knocked and the door flew open.

42
00:02:50.239 --> 00:02:55.920
"Are you still here, you little monkey?" shouted the Black Wind King.

43
00:02:55.921 --> 00:02:58.794
[g@Then he saw the priest and smiled.

44
00:02:58.795 --> 00:03:01.438
"Oh, it's you, my old friend!@g]

45
00:03:01.439 --> 00:03:03.470
[g@Sorry for yelling.

46
00:03:03.471 --> 00:03:07.880
A pesky monkey spirit was here a little while ago."@g]

47
00:03:07.881 --> 00:03:09.308
[g@He looked around.

48
00:03:09.309 --> 00:03:12.150
"I guess he's gone."@g]

49
00:03:12.151 --> 00:03:16.345
"A monkey spirit was here?" asked the priest.

50
00:03:16.346 --> 00:03:18.390
"Yes," said the bear.

51
00:03:18.391 --> 00:03:22.028
[g@"He kept banging on my door and yelling at me.

52
00:03:22.029 --> 00:03:25.573
He was very rude."@g]

53
00:03:25.574 --> 00:03:30.396
The Black Wind King patted the priest on the shoulder.

54
00:03:30.397 --> 00:03:32.836
"But let's not talk about him.

55
00:03:32.837 --> 00:03:34.373
[g@It's good to see you.

56
00:03:34.374 --> 00:03:36.956
How have you been?"@g]

57
00:03:36.957 --> 00:03:39.315
"I'm well," said the priest.

58
00:03:39.316 --> 00:03:43.520
"I brought you a gift, to celebrate your new Buddhist treasure."

59
00:03:43.521 --> 00:03:46.196
He held up the tray with the pill.

60
00:03:46.197 --> 00:03:49.031
[g@The Black Wind King looked interested.

61
00:03:49.032 --> 00:03:52.283
"What kind of pill is that?"@g]

62
00:03:52.284 --> 00:03:56.121
"It is a very special pill," said the priest with a smile.

63
00:03:56.122 --> 00:03:57.949
[g@"I made it just for you.

64
00:03:57.950 --> 00:04:00.521
It will make you live forever."@g]

65
00:04:00.522 --> 00:04:04.029
The Black Wind King stroked his chin.

66
00:04:04.030 --> 00:04:10.943
"You know, I was just thinking this morning that I would like to live forever."

67
00:04:10.944 --> 00:04:14.733
The bear picked up the pill and opened his mouth wide.

68
00:04:14.734 --> 00:04:19.353
As he brought the pill up to his mouth, the pill wiggled.

69
00:04:19.354 --> 00:04:22.026
"Huh? Did the pill just—"

70
00:04:22.027 --> 00:04:27.874
But before the Black Wind King could finish speaking, the pill hopped off his hand.

71
00:04:27.875 --> 00:04:32.799
It shot into his mouth and slid down his throat.

72
00:04:32.800 --> 00:04:36.828
[i@Gulp!@i]

